			"notes": "## Kingdom Come Combat 1.7.2\n\n### Highlights\n\n- Expanded data-driven weapons, combos, passive skills, executions, armor, shields, projectiles, mobs, and combat AI.\n- Improved server-side hit detection, animated weapon hitboxes, blocking, stamina, injury, and combat feedback.\n- Added polearms, shields, firearms, hardships, execution animations, and broader third-party mod compatibility.\n- Improved first-person rendering, humanoid animation compatibility, HUD, configuration, and localization.\n- Added Fabric builds for Minecraft 1.21, 1.21.1, 1.21.6, 1.21.7, 1.21.8, 1.21.10, and 1.21.11.\n- Added NeoForge support for Minecraft 1.21.1.\n- Added a complete English and Chinese extension guide to the README.\n\n### Installation\n\nDownload the JAR matching your mod loader and exact Minecraft version. Fabric builds require Fabric Loader and Fabric API. The NeoForge build targets Minecraft 1.21.1.\n\nAll listed targets were compiled successfully before publication."
